<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Daily Meeting Limit Exceeded</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        
        .email-container {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b 0%, #ee5a24 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .header p {
            font-size: 16px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        
        .content {
            padding: 40px 30px;
        }
        
        .alert-box {
            background-color: #fff3cd;
            border: 1px solid #ffeaa7;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }
        
        .alert-box h2 {
            color: #856404;
            font-size: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
        }
        
        .alert-box h2::before {
            content: "⚠️";
            margin-right: 10px;
            font-size: 24px;
        }
        
        .alert-box p {
            color: #856404;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .stats-container {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin: 30px 0;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .stat-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff6b6b 0%, #ee5a24 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            flex: 1;
            margin: 5px;
            min-width: 150px;
        }
        
        .stat-box h3 {
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        
        .stat-box .value {
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .booking-details {
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 30px 0;
        }
        
        .booking-details h3 {
            color: #495057;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid #ff6b6b;
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .detail-row {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            padding: 8px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        }
        
        .detail-row:last-child {
            border-bottom: none;
        }
        
        .detail-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #495057;
        }
        
        .detail-value {
            color: #6c757d;
        }
        
        .action-section {
            background-color: #e8f5e8;
            border: 1px solid #c3e6c3;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 25px;
            margin: 30px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .action-section h3 {
            color: #155724;
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .action-section p {
            color: #155724;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #28a745 0%, #20c997 100%);
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 12px 30px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }
        
        .cta-button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }
        
        .footer {
            background-color: #343a40;
            color: white;
            padding: 30px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        .footer h4 {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }
        
        .footer p {
            font-size: 14px;
            opacity: 0.8;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .contact-info {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding-top: 20px;
            border-top: 1px solid #495057;
        }
        
        .contact-info a {
            color: #17a2b8;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        
        .contact-info a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            .content {
                padding: 20px 15px;
            }
            
            .stats-container {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            
            .stat-box {
                margin: 5px 0;
            }
            
            .detail-row {
                flex-direction: column;
            }
            
            .detail-label {
                margin-bottom: 5px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="email-container">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Daily Meeting Limit Exceeded</h1>
            <p>Your company has exceeded its daily meeting time limit</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
            <div class="alert-box">
                <h2>Daily Limit Exceeded</h2>
                <p>Dear <%= @company.name %> Team,</p>
                <p>Your company <strong><%= @company.name %></strong> has exceeded its daily meeting time limit. The booking has been created successfully, but please be aware of your daily usage.</p>
            </div>
            
            <div class="stats-container">
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <h3>Daily Limit</h3>
                    <div class="value"><%= @daily_limit %></div>
                    <small>minutes</small>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <h3>Total Used Today</h3>
                    <div class="value"><%= @total_daily_minutes.round(1) %></div>
                    <small>minutes</small>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <h3>Exceeded By</h3>
                    <div class="value"><%= @exceeded_minutes.round(1) %></div>
                    <small>minutes</small>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="booking-details">
                <h3>Latest Booking Details</h3>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Room:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value"><%= @room.name %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Workspace:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value"><%= @workspace.name %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Date:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value"><%= @booking.start_time.strftime('%B %d, %Y') %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Time:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value"><%= @booking.start_time.strftime('%I:%M %p') %> - <%= @booking.end_time.strftime('%I:%M %p') %></span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Duration:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value"><%= @booking.duration_minutes %> minutes</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-row">
                    <span class="detail-label">Status:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value"><%= @booking.status.titleize %></span>
                </div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="action-section">
                <h3>What This Means</h3>
                <p>Your booking has been successfully created, but your company has exceeded its daily meeting time limit. Please consider this when planning future meetings.</p>
                <p><strong>Note:</strong> This is a notification only. Your booking remains active and confirmed.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <h4>NextCo Workspaces</h4>
            <p>Thank you for using our workspace management system.</p>
            <p>This is an automated notification. Please do not reply to this email.</p>
            
            <div class="contact-info">
                <p>For support, contact us at: <a href="mailto:support@nextcoworks.com">support@nextcoworks.com</a></p>
                <p>Visit our website: <a href="https://nextcoworks.com">nextcoworks.com</a></p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html> 